sed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-05-21T07:23:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T17:13:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119621","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119621.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119621.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #88887\n\n## Additional information\n\nAdds editor-only GDScript syntax highlighter tests covering metadata, declarations, annotations, base and engine types, numbers, string names, string placeholders, escape sequences, raw strings, comments, doc comments, comment markers, region markers, node paths, node references, global functions, identifiers, methods, and members.\n\nThe tests set deterministic editor highlighting colors and exercise `GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter` through `TextEdit`, matching the editor-facing code path rather than testing token helpers in isolation.\n\nAI-assisted tooling was used to prepare, review, and audit this patch before submission.\n\nValidation performed:\n\n- `python3 misc/scripts/file_format.py modules/gdscript/tests/test_highlighter.h`\n- `python3 misc/scripts/copyright_headers.py modules/gdscript/tests/test_highlighter.h`\n- `python3 misc/scripts/header_guards.py modules/gdscript/tests/test_highlighter.h`\n- `python3 misc/scripts/validate_includes.py modules/gdscript/tests/test_highlighter.h`\n- `scons platform=macos target=editor tests=yes dev_build=yes vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no -j2`\n- `./bin/godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64 --test --test-suite=\"[Modules][GDScript][SyntaxHighlighter]\"`\n- `./bin/godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64 --test --test-suite=\"[Modules][GDScript]*\"`\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119621/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}